The frequency filter stores only hashes of compound words with a
frequency bucket or a domain number. The counted material cannot be
recovered from it, and its terms are not listed here. What was counted
is recorded per source, with commit and license, in
compound-frequency/manifest.json.

This repository also contains third-party material that is not a dashi
artifact. It is kept as a record of how the artifacts were generated
and evaluated, and it remains under the terms of its providers.

